knowing that you'd come out okay?

00:22:59.625 --> 00:23:02.833
No, of course not. I had no idea.

00:23:04.125 --> 00:23:08.875
Yeah, sure. You must have been surprised, too.

00:23:13.292 --> 00:23:17.292
Okay, well, never do that again, okay?

00:23:24.083 --> 00:23:26.417
If you hadn't come out all right,

00:23:26.417 --> 00:23:30.417
are you saying you were
willing to die? I'm mad at you.

00:23:30.417 --> 00:23:33.125
You are a girl.

00:23:33.125 --> 00:23:36.125
